  "releaseNotes": "'## [10.3.5-prerelease.2](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/compare/v10.3.5-prerelease.1...v10.3.5-prerelease.2) (2026-04-17)\n\n### ⚠ BREAKING CHANGES\n\n* **operator:** decouple ResourceWatcher from Reconciler via queue-based dispatch pipeline (#1060)\n\n### Dependencies\n\n* **core:** update spectre-console monorepo to 0.55.2 ([#1089](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1089)) ([d1554c1](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/d1554c1e371655a78a54ca94dc3d1c18c1fb656a))\n\n### Code Refactoring\n\n* **operator:** decouple ResourceWatcher from Reconciler via queue-based dispatch pipeline ([#1060](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1060)) ([6313f82](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/6313f82bb59b98248e788dd87b8eb1c959e1a5fa))\n'",
